ry must be cold.\n- From statement 11, "All blue, furry things are big," and since Gary is furry (statement 12) and blue (statement 15), it follows that Gary must be big.\n\nTherefore, based on the given information, the statement "Gary is big" is true.\n\n<｜User｜>Please solve the logical reasoning problem. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
