h, young people are round.\n- From point 15, smart people are rough.\n- From point 16, blue, round people are big.\n\nSince Charlie is smart (point 5), he is also quiet (point 10). However, we do not have any direct information about Charlie being round or blue. We only know that blue, round people are rough (point 8), and smart people are rough (point 15). This implies that if someone is blue, they are likely to be rough, but it does not necessarily mean they are round.\n\nGiven the information, we cannot definitively conclude whether Charlie is blue or not. Therefore, the statement "Charlie is not blue" is unknown based on the provided information.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
