big. Since Dave is green and we don\'t have information about his coldness, we cannot conclude that Dave is big.\n- From statement 16, big, cold people are furry. Since Dave is green and we don\'t have information about his coldness or fur, we cannot conclude that Dave is furry.\n\nGiven the information provided, we cannot definitively determine whether Dave is big or not. Therefore, the statement "Dave is not big" is unknown.\n\n<｜User｜>Please solve the logical reasoning problem. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
