hey are big.**.\n    - This tells us that if someone is young and white, they must be big.\n\n12. **Blue people are cold.**.\n    - This tells us that blue people are cold.\n\nNow, let\'s consider the statement "Dave is not big.".\n\nFrom the information provided, we know:.\n- Dave is blue.\n- Dave is white.\n\nHowever, we do not have any direct information about Dave\'s size. We only have information about the sizes and colors of Anne, Bob, and Harry.\n\nSince we do not have any contradictory information about Dave\'s size, and there is no information that directly states Dave is not big, we cannot conclude whether Dave is big or not based solely on the given information.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
