 red.**.\n    - This means that if something is young and quiet, it is red.\n\nNow, let\'s consider the statement "Gary is big.".\n\nFrom the information provided, we know:.\n- Gary is young.\n- Young things are nice.\n- All nice things are quiet.\n- All quiet things are big.\n\nSince Gary is young and nice, and all nice things are quiet, Gary must be quiet. And since all quiet things are big, Gary must be big.\n\nTherefore, the statement "Gary is big" is true based on the given information.\n\n<｜User｜>Please solve the logical reasoning problem. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
