oint 5).\n- Since Harry is rough, and we know that young, rough people are kind (from point 6), it follows that Harry must be young and rough.\n- Since Harry is young and rough, and we know that all quiet, furry people are round (from point 7), it follows that Harry must be round. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
